<title>BRAZIL: Brazilian soybean and product market.</title>
<headline>Brazilian soybean and product market.</headline>
<dateline>RIO DE JANEIRO 1997-04-07</dateline>
<text>
<p>Brokers reported the following Brazilian soybean and products basis levels.</p>
<p>(NS - no seller T-Trade P-Premium D-Discount)</p>
<p> SHIPMENT	  BASIS	  MONTH	   PREVIOUS</p>
<p>Soybean (cents per bushel)</p>
<p>Fob Paranagua</p>
<p> April	     30 D/NS	April	   25/20 D</p>
<p> May		 26/20 D	May	     25/17 D</p>
<p> July	    13 D/even	July	   even/8 P</p>
<p> August	    13/25 P	August	  15/20 P</p>
<p> SHIPMENT	  BASIS	  MONTH	   PREVIOUS</p>
<p>Soymeal/Pellets (dollars per short tonne 48 pct profat)</p>
<p>Fob Paranagua</p>
<p> April	     21/15 D	April	   17/10 D</p>
<p> May		 18/15 D	May	     18/15 D</p>
<p> July		20/18 D	July	    20/15 D</p>
<p> August		8/5 D	August	    4/2 D</p>
<p> SHIPMENT	 BASIS	   MONTH	  PREVIOUS</p>
<p>Soybean Oil (dollars per tonne, points per lb, crude, degummed) Fob Paranagua  April	    100/70 D	April	  100/70 D</p>
